    "title": "DraftKings Sportsbook & Casino",
    "description": "\ud83d\udc51 <b>DraftKings Sportsbook gives you more ways to have skin in the game and get closer to the games you love, all on a safe and secure platform.</b> \ud83d\udc51\r\n\r\nJoin DraftKings's online sportsbook for FREE and win cash money betting on your favorite sports games online, including NFL football & NBA basketball betting, NHL hockey betting, MLB baseball betting, PGA golf betting & UFC betting \u2014 just to name a few.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8 Currently live & accepting bets in: AZ, CO, CT, DC, IL, IN, IA, KS, KY, ME, MD, MA, MI, NH, NJ, NY, NC, OH, OR, PA, TN, VA, VT, WV and WY. \r\n\r\n \ud83c\udfc8 <b>NFL Football is back, baby!</b>  \ud83c\udfc8\r\n\r\nDive into all your favorite sports \u2013 from NFL to MLB, NFL & NHL \u2013 with live sports betting, same game parlays, odds boosts, & free to play pools. We\u2019ve got many ways for you to bet \u2014 and win on NFL Football, MLB baseball, UFC, NHL, NBA & college sports. \ud83c\udfc8 Put your money on the line with live/in-game NFL bets, cross-sport parlays, round robin, NFL basketball bets, single game parlays for baseball & basketball. Or pick the winner in pools to win prizes \ud83d\udcb0\r\n\r\n<b>Getting started & placing bets is easy:</b> \ud83d\udcb8\r\n1.    Create account\r\n2.    Find the sport / outcome you want to bet on\r\n3.    Place a bet & follow along to bet live as the sports action unfolds\r\n\r\nBets with DraftKings Sportsbook are not affiliated with or provided by Google. DraftKings is a US company with headquarters in Boston, Massachusetts. DraftKings is licensed in the State of Connecticut - License OGO.000003\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.draftkings.com/help/privacy/us\r\nCasino available in CT/MI/NJ/PA/WV ONLY\r\n\r\nGAMBLING PROBLEM? CALL 1-800-GAMBLER, (800) 327-5050 or visit gamblinghelplinema.org (MA). Call 877-8-HOPENY/text HOPENY (467369) (NY). Please Gamble Responsibly. 888-789-7777/visit ccpg.org (CT), or visit www.mdgamblinghelp.org (MD).\r\n\r\n21+ (18+ DC/KY/NH/WY). Physically present in AZ/CO/CT/DC/IL/IN/IA/KS/KY/LA(select parishes)/MA/MD/ME/MI/NH/NJ/NY/OH/OR/PA/TN/VA/VT/WV/WY only. Void in ONT. Eligibility restrictions apply. Terms: draftkings.com/sportsbook. On behalf of Boot Hill Casino & Resort (KS).\r\n\r\nTo be eligible, must meet age and eligibility requirements, and opt-in when presented with a promotion. All bonus rewards are subject to maximum wagering limits and expiration restrictions, are single-use, non-cashable, non-refundable, and cannot be withdrawn. Awarded Bonus Bets expire 168 hours after issuance, must be wagered 1x, and stake is not included in winnings. Eligibility, deposit, and wager restrictions may apply. For full terms and conditions, see draftkings.com/sportsbook.\r\n \r\nNFL+ Premium Terms: Offer only for eligible subscribers & must be redeemed by 11:59PM 9/30/24; After 1-month promo period, subscription automatically renews each month at then-current price (currently $14.99/mth) until cancelled; Addt\u2019l terms: nfl.com/terms. Offer Expires 9/19\r\n\r\nTo learn more about current promotions and associated terms, see sportsbook.draftkings.com/promos\r\n\r\nTodas las bonificaciones est\u00e1n sujetas a l\u00edmites m\u00e1ximos de apuesta y restricciones de expiraci\u00f3n, son de un solo uso, no canjeables, no reembolsables, y no pueden retirarse.  Las Apuestas de Bono concedidas caducan 168 horas despu\u00e9s de su emisi\u00f3n, debe apostarse una vez (1x), y la apuesta no se incluye en las ganancias.  Pueden aplicarse restricciones de elegibilidad, dep\u00f3sito, y apuesta.  Para conocer todas las condiciones, v\u00e9ase  draftkings.com/sportsbook.\r\n \r\nPara obtener m\u00e1s informaci\u00f3n sobre las promociones actuales y los t\u00e9rminos asociados, consulte sportsbook.draftkings.com/promos. El contenido de esta aplicaci\u00f3n est\u00e1 totalmente en ingl\u00e9s. Cualquier informaci\u00f3n obtenida o en la que se dependa de la aplicaci\u00f3n se realiza bajo su propio riesgo.",
